        "In Stripe: Developers → API keys → Create restricted key. Allow only 'Checkout Sessions: Read'. Then use a Stripe payment link (buy.stripe.com/…) as the invoice's pay link. Tempo adds the invoice number to the link and checks every 15 minutes.|En Stripe: Desarrolladores → Claves de API → Crear clave restringida. Permite solo 'Checkout Sessions: Read'. Después usa un enlace de pago de Stripe (buy.stripe.com/…) como enlace de pago de la factura. Tempo añade el número de factura al enlace y revisa cada 15 minutos.|Dans Stripe : Développeurs → Clés API → Créer une clé restreinte. Autorisez uniquement « Checkout Sessions : Read ». Utilisez ensuite un lien de paiement Stripe (buy.stripe.com/…) comme lien de paiement de la facture. Tempo ajoute le numéro de facture au lien et vérifie toutes les 15 minutes.|In Stripe: Entwickler → API-Schlüssel → Eingeschränkten Schlüssel erstellen. Nur „Checkout Sessions: Read“ erlauben. Dann einen Stripe-Zahlungslink (buy.stripe.com/…) als Zahlungslink der Rechnung nutzen. Tempo hängt die Rechnungsnummer an und prüft alle 15 Minuten.|No Stripe: Desenvolvedores → Chaves de API → Criar chave restrita. Permita só 'Checkout Sessions: Read'. Depois use um link de pagamento Stripe (buy.stripe.com/…) como link de pagamento da fatura. O Tempo adiciona o número da fatura ao link e verifica a cada 15 minutos.|In Stripe: Sviluppatori → Chiavi API → Crea chiave con restrizioni. Consenti solo 'Checkout Sessions: Read'. Poi usa un link di pagamento Stripe (buy.stripe.com/…) come link di pagamento della fattura. Tempo aggiunge il numero di fattura al link e controlla ogni 15 minuti.|Stripe: 開発者 → API キー → 制限付きキーを作成。「Checkout Sessions: Read」だけを許可します。請求書の支払いリンクには Stripe の支払いリンク (buy.stripe.com/…) を使います。Tempo がリンクに請求書番号を付け、15 分ごとに確認します。|在 Stripe 中:开发者 → API 密钥 → 创建受限密钥,只允许“Checkout Sessions: Read”。然后把 Stripe 付款链接(buy.stripe.com/…)用作发票的付款链接。Tempo 会在链接中加入发票号,并每 15 分钟检查一次。|Stripe: 개발자 → API 키 → 제한된 키 만들기. 'Checkout Sessions: Read'만 허용하세요. 그런 다음 청구서의 결제 링크로 Stripe 결제 링크(buy.stripe.com/…)를 사용하세요. Tempo가 링크에 청구서 번호를 붙이고 15분마다 확인합니다.",
        "In GitHub: Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate. Give it read-only access to Issues and Pull requests on the repositories you work on.|En GitHub: Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate. Dale acceso de solo lectura a Issues y Pull requests en los repositorios en los que trabajas.|Dans GitHub : Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate. Donnez un accès en lecture seule aux Issues et Pull requests des dépôts concernés.|In GitHub: Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate. Gib ihm Lesezugriff auf Issues und Pull Requests deiner Repositorys.|No GitHub: Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate. Dê acesso somente leitura a Issues e Pull requests nos repositórios em que você trabalha.|In GitHub: Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate. Concedi accesso in sola lettura a Issues e Pull request dei repository su cui lavori.|GitHub: Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate。作業するリポジトリの Issues と Pull requests に読み取り専用アクセスを付けてください。|在 GitHub 中:Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate。为你参与的仓库授予 Issues 和 Pull requests 的只读权限。|GitHub: Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate. 작업하는 저장소의 Issues와 Pull requests에 읽기 전용 권한을 주세요.",
